1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,110
Woman: Hey, did you end up making it to Janet's concert last night?

2
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:09,000
Man: I was planning to go

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,200
but I got completely sidetracked helping my cousin move into her new apartment.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,270
It took way longer than expected.

5
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:17,080
Woman: That's too bad, it was incredible

6
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:20,280
She added a saxophonist to her band, you would have loved it.

7
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:25,240
Man: I knew I was missing something special. I hope she'll play again soon.

8
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:30,190
Woman: I think she'll be at the Spring Festival in a couple weeks, so don't make any other plan.
